{"id": "85920", "name": "שברים אלגבריים – סכום p/v + v/q כשבר אחד (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Write</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}, \\]</p><p>as a single fraction.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Add the fractions</b><br>We must add fractions in the usual way to find the answer here: the common denominator is the product of the denominators, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:1}}{{CT:2}}\\)</span>. Expand the first fraction by <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:1}}\\)</span> and the second by <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:2}}\\)</span>, then add the numerators:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\begin{array}{rcl}\\displaystyle {{CT:0}} &\\displaystyle =&\\displaystyle \\frac{({{CT:3}}\\times {{CT:1}}) + {{CT:4}}}{{{CT:1}}{{CT:2}}}, \\\\ &\\displaystyle =&\\displaystyle \\frac{{{CT:5}} + {{CT:4}}}{{{CT:1}}{{CT:2}}}. \\end{array} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "requirelowestterms": true}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "SingleFrac", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "NUM-FRC-TRUE", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "NUM-FRC-FALSE", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["f", "g", "j", "n", "p", "q", "r", "ta", "v"], "nvariants": 50}